        "summary": "Unsubscribe One Click",
        "description": "RFC 8058 target of the List-Unsubscribe header: the mail provider POSTs\n`List-Unsubscribe=One-Click` (form-encoded) with no user interaction.",
        "operationId": "unsubscribe_one_click_api_v1_subscriptions_unsubscribe_one_click_post",
